Boulders can improve STR up to 18, but not above it.

Beyond 18, tins of spinach, potions of gain ability, or eating giant
corpses and royal jelly will improve the strength (and I think magic
traps and fountains can, too).  Royal jelly is always only 1 point,
while giant corpses will improve it by more, so save the royal jelly
that you find until you're pretty high.

Obviously gauntlets of power may be helpful, too, if spellcasting isn't
an issue.



